# Such Sweet Sorrow's edges: a level 75 Warrior in Whitegate with a Merrow Scale. Available at Option 0: out to Al Zahbi
# and into Caedarva Mire: Option 0: no zone-in event; back into Whitegate: Option 0: none (the zone's own). Option 1 (a
# GM): Whitegate's zone-in: not 2: none. Option 2 (a GM): Caedarva's zone-in: not 1: none; Whitegate's: 956 (text table
# 0), finished: begun. A full bag: the scale: 583, finished: the locket does not fit: not completed, the scale kept;
# freed: 583: completed.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/onZoneIn/1 CaedarvaMire/onZoneIn/1 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/583
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=99.4,0,-91.53 job=WAR lvl=75
item MerrowScale
login
warp -64,-7,38 AlZahbi
warp 43.493,5.325,-699.828 CaedarvaMire # Option 0: no zone-in event
warp 99.4,0,-91.53 AhtUrhganWhitegate   # Option 0: no quest zone-in event
charvar Quest[6][13]Option 1            # a GM
warp -64,-7,38 AlZahbi
warp 99.4,0,-91.53 AhtUrhganWhitegate   # Option 1: not 2: none
charvar Quest[6][13]Option 2            # a GM
warp 43.493,5.325,-699.828 CaedarvaMire # Option 2: not 1: none
warp 99.4,0,-91.53 AhtUrhganWhitegate open   # Option 2: 956
finish                                  # begun; Option 0
fill-inventory
trade Dabhuh MerrowScale x1             # accepted: 583 (a trade does not walk: the warp stood beside Dabhuh)
finish                                  # the locket does not fit: not completed, the scale kept
free-inventory
trade Dabhuh MerrowScale x1             # 583
finish                                  # completed
